**`TRACKER_KIND=github-issues`**

Same shape as the GitLab section above, substituting the GitHub REST API
(`https://api.github.com/repos/<owner>/<repo>/issues`, header
`Authorization: Bearer $GITHUB_TOKEN`) for issue creation/closing. Fill in
the exact request bodies during setup by adapting the GitLab example above
to GitHub's issue API if this project uses GitHub Issues as its tracker.
